  "id": "interdependence",
  "term": "interdependence",
  "definition": "Interdependence is a condition in which people’s tasks or efforts are closely linked, so they need to work with one another to reach a shared goal. In teams, higher task interdependence generally promotes cooperation and helps align individual effort with the group’s objectives.",
